UID:evenement9038 @ http://www.resistancemontreal.org
DTSTAMP:20000101T050000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
CREATED:20000101T050000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260718T135730Z 
LOCATION:À déterminer
DESCRIPTION:Expozine 2026\, the 25th annual edition of Montreal’s international independent publishing festival\, will take place from November 6 – 15 2026. The Expozine fair will take place on Saturday\, November 14 and Sunday\, November 15\, 2026. Applications for the Expozine fair will be available through the Expozine website starting in August\, 2026. Instagram : @expozinemtl
