DESCRIPTION:𝗭𝗜𝗡𝗘 𝗟𝗔𝗨𝗡𝗖𝗛 𝗧𝗵𝘂𝗿𝘀𝗱𝗮𝘆\, 𝗝𝘂𝗹𝘆 𝟮𝟯\, 𝟲 𝗽𝗺 𝗦𝗰𝗿𝗲𝗲𝗻𝗶𝗻𝗴 6:30 : The Secret Lives of Lesbian Cats (2023) 6:45 : Flow (2024) Free drinks & snacks At L'Euguélionne bookstore 1426 Beaudry Street Join us for a cozy evening celebrating the launch of the collaborative zine 𝘾𝙖𝙩𝙨 𝙖𝙣𝙙 𝙩𝙝𝙚𝙞𝙧 𝙙𝙮𝙠𝙚𝙨. More than 20 contributors\, 64 pages\, full color. PWYC\, all profits go to @allcatsarebeautifulcollective. 😺
